  "_purpose": "The scene files of the lab's roster (roster.json beside this file), each forked once, byte for byte, from the @descix/frqtl-web 0.6.1 showcase scenes at their source commit ece80858 (lib/frqtl/scenes/<name>.js there), when 0.7.0 moved the scenes out of the package. A file sits at <sha8>/<name>.js, sha8 the first 8 hex of its own sha256, so a changed scene is a new URL (the edge caches some names for a year). Each entry records the bytes' sha256 and their git blob id at that commit; scripts/test/scenes-fork.test.mjs holds every file to both, every roster source to an entry and every entry to a source. A scene file changes only by a new fork: new bytes, a new entry, the old file deleted.",
